  "description": {
   "en": "Iwai Shiori (35), a woman past her prime. When a man named Date Mizuki (27) moves next door, her dreary, unchanging life is turned upside-down! And the cause of this change… is the fact that she sees him as a fish!? But ever since she spent the night with Date-kun, she starts seeing him as a handsome man every now and then…!? Shiori's love story rapidly unfolds!",
   "ja": "冴えない栞(35)の隣に【魚男】が引っ越して来て、代わり映えのない毎日が激変!! 魚男が時々超絶イケメンに見えるのはなぜ――!? そして栞の恋が動き始める…"
  },
